  "description": "Official .NET SDK for Duro, a product lifecycle management platform. Provides a typed GraphQL client (IGraphQLClient) for every operation Duro's own integrations use, plus opinionated service wrappers (CPN validation, more coming). Multi-targets netstandard2.0 (works on .NET 6+, .NET Framework 4.8, Unity, Mono) and net48 (legacy COM hosts). Bearer JWT or x-api-key auth via a pluggable IDuroCredentialProvider.",
